{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21617204","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.21617204","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.21617204","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:21617204","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:21617204"}],"creators":[{"name":"Singaravelu, Divya","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Divya","familyName":"Singaravelu","nameIdentifiers":[],"affiliation":[]},{"name":"Rajendran, Suresh","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Suresh","familyName":"Rajendran","nameIdentifiers":[],"affiliation":[]}],"titles":[{"title":"Replication Code, Artifiacts"}],"publisher":"Zenodo","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-07-27","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":null,"types":{"ris":"RPRT","bibtex":"article","citeproc":"article-journal","schemaOrg":"ScholarlyArticle","resourceType":"Software documentation","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.21617203","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":null,"rightsList":[],"descriptions":[{"description":"Replication code, trained model artefacts, and the processed labelled datasets for research paper - \n\nOrder-Flow Toxicity in Cryptocurrency Perpetual Futures: Order Flow Signals, Price-Impact Persistence, and the Limits of Volatility-Based Metrics\n\n \n\nbtc_raw_labeled_dataset.zipThis archive contains the processed, feature-engineered labelled dataset (labeled_final) for BTC/USDT, not raw exchange data. It includes all 21 lagged order-flow and volatility features, the corrected tox_A toxicity label, and forward price-impact fields, at one-second resolution across the paper's 360 out-of-sample days. This is the dataset underlying every BTC/USDT table in the manuscript at the primary (80th/75th percentile) label threshold. The two label-threshold sensitivity variants reported in Table 19 (permissive 70th/65th percentile, restrictive 90th/85th percentile) are not included in this archive and are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request. Raw order book and trade data are not included here; see the Bybit source link below.\n\neth_labeled_dataset.zipContains the processed, feature-engineered labelled dataset (labeled_final) for ETH/USDT, structured identically to the BTC dataset above: 21 lagged order-flow and volatility features, the tox_A toxicity label, and forward price-impact fields, at one-second resolution across 360 out-of-sample days. This is the dataset underlying every ETH/USDT table in the manuscript. Raw order book and trade data are not included here; see the Bybit source link below.\n\nbtc_model_and_predictions.zipTrained model artefacts and out-of-sample predictions for all model specifications evaluated on BTC/USDT: No-vol-19, Full-21, Pure-vol-2, LR-19 (logistic regression), VPIN, and the two reduced-feature benchmarks (Simple-flow-4, Simple-return-4), plus the two label-threshold sensitivity variants (permissive 70/65, restrictive 90/85) of the primary No-vol-19 specification. Each model folder contains per-day trained classifier and quantile regressor files (walk-forward, one model pair per out-of-sample day) and the corresponding daily prediction outputs (predicted probability, predicted severity, combined TailScore) used to construct every BTC/USDT result table in the manuscript.\n\neth_model_and_predictions.zipTrained model artefacts and out-of-sample predictions for all model specifications evaluated on ETH/USDT: No-vol-19, Full-21, Pure-vol-2, LR-19, VPIN, and the two reduced-feature benchmarks (Simple-flow-4, Simple-return-4). Structured identically to the BTC archive above, with per-day trained model files and daily prediction outputs used to construct every ETH/USDT result table in the manuscript.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21617204","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":1,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-07-27T11:07:47.000Z","registered":"2026-07-27T11:07:47.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-08-23T14:11:43.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21617204","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21617203","type":"dois"}]}}}}